message: >-
  If you use this software, analysis, maps, or derived results, please cite
  Walker Rowe's project and identify DeepStateMap.Live as the data source:
  https://deepstatemap.live/en#6/49.4383200/32.0526800
title: DeepState Battlefield Change Analysis
type: software
authors:
