repository-code: https://github.com/werowe/hypatia_lab/tree/main/deepstate
url: https://github.com/werowe/hypatia_lab/tree/main/deepstate
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A geospatial workflow for detecting, measuring, and mapping battlefield
  status transitions in historical DeepStateMap.Live geometry. The analytical
  concepts, project design, and most code are by Walker Rowe and were enhanced
  with AI tools. DeepStateMap.Live supplies the underlying map data at
  https://deepstatemap.live/en#6/49.4383200/32.0526800.
